    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/dbb74acd8ea7257d23d2f132ed62a999.avif?t=1753428410\" /></div>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/ff1766a91217ddd70f8f599db630bbb2.avif?t=1753428410\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Welcome to the world of Witchfall</strong></i><strong>, a land filled with adventure!</strong>. It is yet another </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">typical day at the Lludwick school of wizardry, when suddenly.. disaster strikes!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six fledgling friends find themselves chasing down a band of wicked thieves to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">recover the mystical EMOTICA SHARDS which must not fall into the wrong hands!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many wacky and wonderful adventures await our little heroes..\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/6b99cbbecaa3959631a4c6f2d9f51885.avif?t=1753428410\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/1bb1c0ebf13246c019ba99ad720ef5c9.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/5d3acbdf1537cf0ecce6a5df764b514a.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/b8a10bbad390df5fdb9a868a66c7c646.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/049199d292aee000d3d3148c22f4b703.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/566a1788d14cca959aaa9299164345e3.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/2232395d5269047f17a49d772d0011d8.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/1bb1c0ebf13246c019ba99ad720ef5c9.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/5d3acbdf1537cf0ecce6a5df764b514a.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/b8a10bbad390df5fdb9a868a66c7c646.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686780/extras/049199d292aee000d3d3148c22f4b703.webp?t=1753428410\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- GAME FEATURES -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- Five Playable characters each with their own abilities!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- Exciting 2D Platforming action that will keep you on your toes!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- Over 30 Colorful and Challenging Stages to master!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- A wide range of mini games to uncover!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- Hundreds of scattered fruits for completionists to find!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- Tons of Collectible Cards to Collect!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar